            "review_title": "Review at Quan Thuy 94 Cu",
            "review_text": "コージヤマモト\nHiroshima, Japan547 contributions\n0\nMichelin also benchmarks crab dishes\nAug 2026 • Business\nA restaurant that serves mud crab, one of Vietnam's specialty dishes. It's a shop full of local people, a little away from Letanton.\nBut\nBut\nIt has been rated by Michelin for three consecutive years.\nThe amount of crab meat generously packed into every dish, and the exquisite seasoning.\nGrandma, who is having trouble choosing a menu, recommends a dish and orders it for me without asking. A sight you see in Japan too?!\nEven if you can get it from Letanto, the usage fee is small, so it's not a waste of coming here!\nThank you for the meal ❤️\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten August 28, 2026",
