            "review_text": "RonTang\nSingapore, Singapore534 contributions\n0\nTasty Crab Dishes\nDec 2025 • Couples\nLocated along a really busy street. Paid street side parking for bikes are available, not sure about parking for cars. Indoor and outdoor seating are available. Outdoor seating is along an alley beside the eatery which is clean and well kept. We ordered the clear vermicelli fried flavorfully with loads of crab meat. We also ordered the fully de-shelled deep fried crab meat which is a delight to eat, especially when one doesn’t have to get one’s hands dirty and all the hassle of eating crab. We had a wonderful dinner here and would recommend this place for gathering of friends, family, colleagues, and couples. It is child and wheelchair friendly.\nRead more\nWritten December 31, 2025",
