            "review_title": "Review at Quan Thuy 94 Cu",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n32\nFabulous MICHELIN rated crab restaurant continues to serve quality food\nNov 2024 • Friends\nBack In Saigon after close to two months in Sydney and this is one of the first places I have come back to. This time a friend and I had a late lunch, 3 soups and crab spring rolls. Regardless of the simplicity of the dishes they all deliver pure satisfaction. I just can’t believe how consistent they are with their quality and also how affordable it is. Today’s lunch for two (and we were totally full by the end of it) was just on 600,000 vnd, including two beers!\n\nDo yourself a favour and check it out. Where else can you have Michelin rated food for so little??\nRead more\nWritten November 29, 2024",
