            "review_title": "Review at Quan Thuy 94 Cu",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n41\nAuthentic Vietnamese Crab Dishes - Michelin Selected\nSep 2024 • Friends\nIf you ever asked can you eat at a Michelin selected restaurant affordably? Then this is the place for you! \n\nThis place only does Crabs (of the sea variety). OMG, the food is sensational and very reasonably priced for the whole family. Everything from incredible soups to huge soft shell crabs to even more incredible crab spring rolls which you wrap up in Vietnamese greens before devouring them and don’t forget the crispy stir fried noodles with prawns and crab meat and my fav the whole crabs in tamarind sauce …. where do I stop?!\n\nSeriously between the two of us, we probably over ordered. With two lots of drinks each as well the bill was still under 1,200,000 … that is 600k each. A very normal nights meal out with friends in Saigon. Only difference is it is a Michelin selected restaurant. Total bargain and very satisfying. Just don’t expect silver service or totally attentive staff, this is not that type of dining. But if you are after authentic, delicious Vietnamese Crab dishes, you will be in heaven..\nRead more\nWritten September 23, 2024",
